    <section class="core-section-container
        core-section-container--with-border border-b-1 border-solid border-color-border-faint py-4 text-color-text" data-test-id="about-us">
<!---->
          <h2 class="core-section-container__title section-title">
            About us
          </h2>

<!---->
      <div class="core-section-container__content break-words">
        

          <p class="break-words text-color-text" data-test-id="about-us__description">
              MERJ EXCHANGE is a licensed and regulated multi-asset, multi-currency securities and digital assets exchange.  MERJ is pioneering the next generation of global financial markets leveraging blockchain technology to create the world’s first truly global, direct access end to end regulated exchange built for the digital era. 

+ MERJ Exchange is a regulated securities exchange with support for digital and non digital securities. Institutional grade matching engine and support for direct access as well as professional network of members and brokers. 

+ MERJ CLEAR is a Clearing Agency supporting guaranteed delivery vs payment and real time gross settlement for digital and non digital securities. Licensed by the Central Bank of Seychelles under the National Payment System Regulation, 2014.

+ MERJ DEP is a licensed securities facility and depository with support for traditional database as well distributed ledger recorded registries. Vertically integrated into MERJ Clear and MERJ Exchange offering real time registry updates.

+ MERJ NOMINEES is a nominee company wholly owned by MERJ DEP.

MERJ Vision:

- Primary and secondary markets, exchange, clearing, settlement, registry/depository
- Global deal promotion, issuance and distribution platform for compliant global securities token offerings
- Primary, secondary and cross listings from global issuers
- Direct access to exchange and post trade for global participants
- Fully fledged national securities exchange (i.e. listed securities qualify as “listed” for investment mandates)
- Interoperability with markets across the globe to support cross listings
- Affiliate member of the World Federation of Exchanges 
- Immutable cap tables and ownership registers maintained on a distributed ledger 
- Multi-asset - equity, debt and derivative securities, including tokens, digital and hybrid instruments
- Multi-currency instruments / settlement in major currencies
          </p>

